OL,3,GNEWSAHuge solar farm set to cost #1bn
OL,4,
OL,5,FA proposed solar farm which would cover
OL,6,F2,700 acres (1,090 hectares) of
OL,7,Fcountryside would cost #1bn to build,
OL,8,Faccording to the company behind the
OL,9,Fplans.
OL,11,FDeveloper Island Green Power (IGP) has
OL,12,Fsaid the East Pye scheme on land near
OL,13,FLong Stratton in Norfolk will generate
OL,14,Fenough power for 115,000 homes.
OL,16,FBut the plan has been strongly opposed
OL,17,Fby nearby residents and campaign
OL,18,Fgroups, concerned about the loss of
OL,19,Fagricultural land and impact on the
OL,20,Fcountryside.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
